    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy &amp; Data Transparency</string>
    <string name="privacy_statement">Echo operates entirely in volatile RAM. No audio is ever recorded to disk, uploaded to the cloud, or transmitted across the network. All processing occurs locally on your device in real-time.</string>
